      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed spinel-type oxide layer will form in situ at elevated temperature under friction.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineered oxide layer will be continuous and stable during tribo-corrosion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A compact oxide layer can act as a diffusion barrier and hinder further oxidative or corrosive attack.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A spinel-type oxide layer on this HEA will resist mechanical wear.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified surface composition enhances the thermodynamic driving force for formation of a stable oxide layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The service-formed oxide layer will be self-healing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will isolate the alloy surface from the aggressive environment and reduce corrosive dissolution.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
